    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "From the creative team that brought you House of M and Siege comes a blistering first chapter in Marvel's new explosive event. Watch as the players are introduced and the table is set for a storyline that fans will be talking about for years."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set between this issue 0 and number 1 is the special Free Comic Book Day 2016 (Civil War II) one-shot, which features the death of a mayor Marvel hero."
